>>>
>>> telgau
>>> *lujvo* g1 locks lock s1 on s2 by mechanism s3.
>>> Cf. stela, gasnu, telga'o, ga'orgau.
>>>
>>> telcaugau
>>> *lujvo* g1 unlocks/unseals c1=s2 using lock/seal s1 with mechnism s3.
